  "sourceLocator": {
    "chapter": "Classes",
    "section": "3.349",
    "heading": "Level 20: Signature Spells",
    "lineStart": 4687,
    "lineEnd": 4689
  },
  "section": "3.349",
  "rulesText": "Choose two level 3 spells in your spellbook as your signature spells. You always have these spells prepared, and you can cast each of them once at level 3 without expending a spell slot. When you do so, you can't cast them in this way again until you finish a Short or Long Rest. To cast either spell at a higher level, you must expend a spell slot."
}
